<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Galatia</book>
  <para style="h">Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatia</para>
  <para style="mt">Galatia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei Paula, tirhkoh, mihring tirh ni lo, mihring ruat pawh ni lo, Isua Krista leh mitthi zîng ata amah kaithotu Pa Pathian ruata hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kan hnêna unau awm zawng zawngte nên hian, Galatia rama kohhrante chibai kan bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian, kan Pa leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian, kan Pa duhzâwng zâwmin, tûn hun ṭha lo laka min chhan chhuak tûr leh kan sualte min tlen faisak tûrin, Krista chu amah a inpe ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian hnênah chuan ropuina chatuan chatuanin awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista khawngaihnaa kotu che u chu kalsanin, ‘Chanchin Ṭha’ chi dang in pawm leh ta thut mai hi mak ka va ti êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha chi dang a awm lo asin, nangmahni tibuaitute khân Krista Chanchin Ṭha tihdanglam an tum mai a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keini pawh ni ila, vân ata lo chhuk vântirhkoh pawh ni sela, kan hrilh tawh che u ni lo, ‘Chanchin Ṭha’ an rawn hrilh che u chuan ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hrilh tawh che u a, tûnah pawh ka hrilh nawn leh a che u: in pawm tawh ni lo, ‘Chanchin Ṭha’ dang rawn hrilhtu apiang che u chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tûnah hian mihring nge tihlâwm ka tum Pathian? Mihring lâwmzâwng sawi tum angin ka lo lang ṭhîn em ni? Mihring tihlâwm tum ni ila Krista bawih ka ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute u, ka hrilh a che u, Chanchin Ṭha ka hril hi mihring laka chhuak a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu hnên aṭang maha dawng ka ni lo va, tu man mi zirtîr hek lo; Isua Krista ngei chuan ka hnêna a puan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda fîr ka nih laia ka awm dân in hria e, Pathian Kohhran nasa takin ka tiduhdah a, nuai bo ka tum ṭhîn a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan sakhaw biakna lama thlahtute thu hlan chhâwn vawn chungchângah pawh ka rualpui Juda-te zîngah a firfiak ber ka ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian chuan ka nu pum chhûng aṭangin mi serh hrang a, a khawngaihnain mi ko ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jentail-te zînga a Chanchin Ṭha ka hril theih nân a Fapa chu ka hnêna rawn puan ṭha a tih thu mi hriattîr lai khân mi dang tu mah ka râwn lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ka nih ve hmaa tirhkoh lo ni tawh Jerusalem-a mite hnênah ka kal hek lo. Arabia ramah ka kal ta daih zâwk a; tin, Damaska khuaah ka lo kîr leh ta chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kum thum hnuah erawh chuan Jerusalem-ah Kifa hmêlhriat tûrin ka han kal a, a hnênah ni sâwm leh panga ka châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa unau Jakoba tih loh chu tirhkoh dangte tu mah ka hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thu ziak hi a dik a ni, Pathian hmaah pawh ka daw lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Suria leh Kilikia ramah te ka kal leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judai rama Kristian Kohhrante phei chuan mi la hmêlhriat lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Hmâna min tiduhdahtu khân rinna thu nuai bo a tum ṭhin kha a hril ve ta thung,” tih thâwm chauh an hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ka chunga thil thleng avângin Pathian an fak a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pali a vei hnuin Barnaba nên Jerusalem-ah kan han kal leh a, Tita pawh kan hruai bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathianin mi tirh avânga kal ka ni. Hruaitu lian deuh deuhte chauh a fâlin ka hmu a, Jentail-te hnêna Chanchin Ṭha ka tlângaupui ṭhin hi ka hrilh hlawm a, tûn hma leh tûna ka rawngbâwl zêlna hi hahthlâk thlâwn mai a nih lohna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka mi hruai Tita pawh chu Grik mi a ni na a, serh an tan luihtîr chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ringtu der, Isua Kristaa zalênna kan neih enthla tûra an zînga lût ru vete erawh chuan bawiha luhtîr leh min tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Chanchin Ṭha thu dik chu in tân an tihdanglam loh nân an thu chhe tê pawh zawm kan duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hruaitu pawimawh nia langte chu an nih tak tak leh tak tak loh ka tân a dang chuang lo, Pathianin pâwn lam lan dân mai a ngaisâng lo ve, hêng mite ngei pawh hian sawi tûr eng mah an nei chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Neih ahnêkin Petera chu serh tante zînga Chanchin Ṭha hrilh hna kawltîr a ni ang bawkin, serh tan lohte hnêna Chanchin Ṭha hrilh hna ka hnênah kawltîr a ni tih an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Serhtante tâna tirhkoh ni tûra Petera thuamtu chuan, Jentail-te tâna tirhkoh ni tûrin kei pawh mi thuam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, kohhran bana an ngaih ber Jakoba te, Kifa te leh Johana te pawh chuan he chanvo ka dawn hi an hmuhin, thawk ho kan nih entîr nân Barnaba nên inpâwlna kut ding lam min pe ta zâwk a; keinin Jentail-te zîngah rawng kan bâwl ang a, anniin serh tante zîngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An zînga retheite erawh chu hre reng tûrin mi phût a, chu lah chu ka lo tum sa rêng a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Kifa chu Antiokei khuaa a lo kal lai khân demawm takin a awm a, a langin hmai chhanah ka khak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jentail-te zîngah chaw a ei ve ṭhîn a; mahse, Jakoba tirh mi ṭhenkhat Jentail serhtantîr tumtute chu a hlau va, an lo thlen hnu chuan a tîm a, a inthiarfihlîm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda dangte pawh chuan a tih dân chu an zui ve a, Barnaba meuh pawh an tih dân chuan a hruai kawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An thiltih dân chu Chanchin Ṭha thu nên a inhmeh lo tih ka hmuhin, an zaa hmaah Kifa hnênah chuan, “Nang Juda i ni a, Juda anga awm lovin Jentail-te angin i han khawsa a, chuti chung chuan engtizia nge Jentail-te chu Juda mi anga awmtîr i tum?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keini zawng Juda mi rênga piang kan ni a, ‘Jentail mi sual,’ an tih ṭhinte kan ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Dân zawm vâng ni lovin, Isua Krista rin avâng chauhvin miin Pathian hmaah thiam an chang thei a ni tih kan hria; Dân zawm vâng ni lova, Krista rin avânga Pathian hmaa thiam kan chan theih nân, keini ngei pawh hian Kristaah chuan rinna kan nghat a ni. Tu man Dân zawm avângin Pathian hmaah thiam an chang zo lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Krista rin avânga Pathian hmaa thiam chan tum keiniho hi, ‘Jentail mi sualte ang chiaha ngaih kan nih si chuan, Krista chuan sual rawng a lo bâwl tihna em ni?’ Ni awkawng lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lo ṭhiat tawh Dân vêk chu din thar leh ka tum si chuan, a bawhchhetu ka ni tih a chiang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei chuan Dân avângin Dân chu ka thihsan tawh a ni; Pathian lama ka nun theih nân Krista hnênah krawsa khenbeh ka ni tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima nun pangngaia nung ka ni tawh lo va; keimahah hian Krista chu a nung tawh zâwk a ni. Tûna tisaa ka nung hi, mi hmangaiha ka tâna nun petu, Pathian Fapa ringa nung ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian khawngaihna hi ka hnâwl dâwn lo. Dân zawm avânga Pathian hmaa thiam chan theih a nih chuan, Krista thihna hi a thlâwn mai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Galatia rama mi â-te u, tu nge dawi che u? In mit ngeia hmu ve ang maia chiangin Krista khenbeh thu hrilh in nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Min hrilh teh u, Thlarau in dawn kha Dân in zawm vâng nge, Chanchin Ṭha in hriata in rin tâk vâng?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuti êma â in lo ni maw? Thlarauva ṭan tawh siin tisa thilah in tâwp dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In chunga thil thleng zozai kha engmah lo mai mai em ni? Ni âwm lo tak le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Phal taka thlarau pe che ua, in zînga thil mak ti ṭhîntu Pathian khân, Dân in zawm avânga ti nge a nih, Chanchin Ṭha in hriat in awih tâk avângin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Abrahama chuan Pathian a ring a, thiam changah pawm a ni ta,” tih ang khân a ni zâwk asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abrahama fa dik takte chu ringtute hi an ni tih hre ta che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lehkha Thu chuan Jentail-te pawh rinna avângin Pathian chuan thiam a chantîr dâwn tih a lo hmu lâwk a; tichuan, Abrahama hnênah, “Nangmahah chuan hnam tin malsâwmin an awm ang,” tiin Chanchin Ṭha chu a lo hril diam tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Abrahaman a rin anga ring ve apiangin malsâwmna chu an dawng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dân zawm innghah nâna hmangte chu ânchhe dawng mai an ni; “Dân lehkha thu-a chuang zawng zawng zâwma ti vek lo chu ânchhe dawng an ni,” tih ziak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dân zawm avângin Pathian hmaah tu mah thiam chang zo an awm lo tih a chiang a ni, “Rinna avânga thiam chang chu a nung ang,” tih a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dân chuan, “Thupêk zâwm vektu chu a nung ang,” a ti mai a, rinna a sawi tel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Thinga khai chu ânchhe dawng a ni,” tia ziak ang khân, Krista chuan kan tân ânchhia chu phurin, Dân ânchhe lak ata min chhan chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathianin Abrahama mal a sâwmna chu Jentail-te hnênah Kristaah chuan a lo thleng ta a, keini hian Thlarau pêk tiam chu rinna avângin kan lo dawng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unaute u, entîr nân mihring tih dân han sawi ta ila - Miten thu an lo thlun fel tawh chuan, mihring thuthlung mai a ni nain tu man an phelh leh ngai lo, belh pawh an belh ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abrahama leh a chi thlah hnênah chauh Pathianin thu a tiam a nih kha; mi tam tak chungchâng a sawi lo, chi thlahte ti lovin, mi mal thu sawiin, “I chi thlah,” a ti zâwk a ni, chu mi chu Krista hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka sawi tum chu hei hi a ni - Kum zali leh sawmthum hnua dân lo awm ta khân Pathian thuthlun chu a ṭhiat chuang lo, a thutiam pawh chu a tidanglam chuang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dân zawm avângin roluahtu nih theih se, Pathian thutiam vâng a ni lo vang; Pathian erawh chuan a thutiam avângin a ni Abrahama hnênah roluahtu tûr a pêk tâk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuti ni se, Dân hi engati nge pêk a nih? Bawhchhiatna hi eng ang tak nge tih tilang tûrin vântirhkohte palaia hmangin pêk a ni; Abrahama hnêna Fa a tiam kha a lo lan hma atân chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi pakhat tân palai awm a ṭûl lo ve, Pathian chu pakhat chauh a ni si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuti ni se, Pathian thutiam hi Dân hian a kalh em ni? Kalh teh suh e! Mi tinung thei Dân pêk ni sela, chu Dân zawm avâng chuan Pathian hmaah tu pawh thiam chan theih a ni ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lehkha Thu chuan, “Engkim hi sual thuhnuaiah a awm tawh,” a ti a; tichuan, Isua Krista rin avânga dawn tûr thiltiam chu a ring apiangte hnêna pêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rinna thu a lo thlen hma kha chuan Dânin mi a khuahkhirh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />rinna thu tihlan fiah a nih hma chuan min kaihruai a. Tin, rinna avânga thiam kan chan theihna tûrin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dân chu Krista lama min kaihruaitu a ni a; mahse, rinna thu chu a lo thlen tâk avângin kaihruaitu hnuaiah kan awm tawh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, Krista Isua in rinna avângin in za-in Pathian fate in ni ta;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kristaa baptisma chang apiangte chu Krista chuan in inthuam ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Juda leh Jentail, bawih leh bawih lo, mipa leh hmeichhia a awm chuang tawh lo, Isua Kristaah chuan in za-in pumkhat in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Krista mi in nih tawh chuan Abrahama thlahte in ni, thutiam anga roluahtu tûrte chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka sawi tum chu han sawi zêl ila: Fapa chu ro zawng zawng khâwmtu tûr ni mah se, naupang a la nih chhûng chu a neitu tak a ni chungin bawih ang leka cheibâwl a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a pa hun tiam a thlen hma chu enkawltute hnuaiah a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keini pawh chutiang chuan kan awm - naupang kan nih lai khân khawvêl zirtîrna dik lo hnuaiah bawih kan ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hun tak a lo thlen meuh chuan Pathianin a Fapa chu a rawn tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chu Dân hnuaia awmte min tlan tûr leh fapa dinhmuna min dintîr tûrin, hmeichhe laka piangin Dân hnuaiah a rawn seilentîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fa in ni tih a chian nân Pathian chuan a Fapa Thlarau chu kan thinlung chhûngah a rawn tîr a, “Abba, ka Pa,” tiin a au chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, bawih in ni tawh lo va, fa in ni ta zâwk a, fa in nih chuan Pathian zâra roluahtu tûrte in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûn hma khân Pathian in la hre ngai lo va; chuvângin, an pianphung rêng pawha Pathian ni hlei lote bawihah in awm ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah zawng Pathian in lo zawm ta a - Pathianin a zawm ta che u tih tûr a ni zâwk mah ang chu; engtizia nge khawvêl zirtîrna dik lo mai mai, eng mah ni hlei lote lam in hawia, an bawih nih leh in duh tâk mai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni te, thla te, hun te, kum te serh bîk in neih leh tâk hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In tân tha ka sêng thlâwn ang tih ka hlau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaute u, keimah anga awm tûrin ka ngên a che u, nangmahni ang maiin kei pawh ka awm a, tu man mi tihchhiat ngai loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In hnêna Chanchin Ṭha ka rawn hril hmasak ṭum kha ka bawrhsâwm vâng a ni tih in hria e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka taksa chu in tân buaipuiawm tak ni mah se, mi hmusit lo va, mi ten hek lo; Pathian vântirhkoh ang maiin, Isua Krista ni hial âwmin mi lo lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Theih ni phei se in mitte kher chhuakin mi pêk in huam tih ka hria; nihlawh in intih tehlul nên, engtizia nge ni ta?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In hnêna thu dik tak ka sawi avângin in hmêlma ka ni ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi dodâltute hian a ṭha lam zâwnga rawn ngaihsak che u an ni lo va, lâk hran che ua, anmahni in hlutsak an duh vâng mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In zînga ka awm loh pawhin a ṭha lam zâwnga rawn ngaihsak che u mi dang an awm phawt chuan a lâwmawm zêl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Naute u, Krista anna in neih hma chu nau veiin ka vei leh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tûnah in zînga chêng ni ila ka va ti êm, ka aw ki pawh a dang tûr! A tihngaihna tak ka hre lo va che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dân hnuaia awm duhte u, mi hrilh rawh u, Dân thu chu in hre lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Abrahama chuan fapa pahnih a nei a, pakhat chu bawihnu fa, pakhat chu chhûngpuinu fa,” tih ziak a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawihnu fa chu mihring dân pangngai anga hrin a ni a, chhûngpuinu fa erawh chu Pathian thutiam vânga hrin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hêng hi tehkhinna a ni; chûng nu pahnihte chu thuthlung pahnih entîrna an ni - pakhat chu Sinai tlâng aṭanga lo chhuak kha a ni a, chu chu Hagari a ni a, a fa hrinte chu bawih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hagari chu Arabia rama Sinai tlâng entîrna a ni a; tûnlai Jerusalem khua nên angkhat a ni, a chhûnga chêngte nên bawih an ni hlawm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chung lam Jerusalem erawh chu bawih a ni lo, chu chu keini nu hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Nang ching, fa hrin nei lo, lâwm la, Nang nau vei ngai lo, hlim takin au rawh, Pasal nei ai chuan hrin nei lo nu chuan Fa a ngah zâwk si a,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, unaute u, Isaka ang bawka Pathian thutiam fate in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mihring dân pangngai anga hrin khân Thlarau thiltihtheihnaa hrin chu a tiduhdah ang khân tûnah pawh a nih zêl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-ah engtia ziak nge ni kha? “Bawihnu chu a fapa nên hnawt chhuak rawh, bawihnu fapa chuan chhûngpuinu fapa chu ro a luahpui tûr a ni lo,” tih a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, unaute u, bawih fa kan ni lo va, chhûngpuinu fate kan ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Krista chuan min zalêntîr ta a, in zalênnaah hian ding tlat ula, bawih nghâwngkawl bât leh tawh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh u, kei Paula ngei hian ka hrilh a che u - serh in tan chuan Krista chu in hlâwkpui lo tawp ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Serh tan apiang hnênah hei hi ka sawi duh a ni - Dânin a phût zawng zawng chu an ti law law tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dân zawm avânga thiam chan tumte u, Krista hnên ata in intan fithla a, khawngaihna chu in chhuahsan ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keini zawng Thlarau zârah rinna avânga thiam channa chu beiseiin kan nghâkhlel takmeuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isua Kristaa kan awm phawt zawngin serh tan emaw, tan loh emaw a danglam chuang lo; hmangaihnaa thuam rinna hi a pawimawh ber mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hma in sâwn ṭhat ṭhin vei nên, tu ber kherin nge thutak tlûksan tûra hruai bo ta che u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />He hruai kawina hi a kotu che u laka chhuak a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dawidim tlêm têin chhang hlâwm lian pui pawh a fan chhuak thei tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa pakhata awm za kan nih avângin rilru hrang in la put loh kei chuan ka ring tlat a ni; nangmahni chawk buaitu chu tu pawh ni se, hrem a la tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute u, kei hian serh tan a ṭûl tiin lo hril ṭhîn ila, engah nge mi tihduhdah ang? Chuti ni se, kraws thu kan hril hian buaina a siam lo tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmahni tibuaitute hi in zîng ata intan fithla law law ang hmiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute u, nangni zawng zalênna nei tûra koh in ni a, in zalênna hi tisa tâna remchângah hmang lul suh u; inhmangaih tawnin rawng inbâwlsak zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte pawh hmangaih rawh,” tih thu kam khat hi in zawm chuan Dân zawng zawng in zâwm a ni mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ran ang maia inbeih leh intihnat in chîn chuan fîmkhur rawh u, in intiboral tawn mai dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka sawi tum chu hei hi a ni: Thlarauvah awm ula, tisa châkna chu in zâwm tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tisa duhzâwng chuan thlarau lam thil a kalh tlat a, Thlarau lahin tisa lam thil chu a kalh tlat bawk a, an inkalh tawn tlat avângin in tih duh eng mah in ti thei ṭhîn lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlarau hruaia in awm zawngin Dân hnuaiah in awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tisa mite thiltih chu a lang chiang a ni - inngaihna te, bawlhhlawhna te, hurna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />milem biakna te, dawi te, inhuat te, innghirngho te, thîkna te, thinchhiat te, mahni hmasial te, intihdarh te, inṭhen te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />inîtsîk te, zu ruih chîn te, zu hmuna nuam tâwl te leh chutiang chi chu. Chutiang ti mite chuan Pathian ram an luah tawp lo vang tih ka hrilh tawh che u angin ka hrilh nawn leh a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlarau rah zawng hmangaihna te, lâwmna te, remna te, dawhtheihna te, ngilneihna te, ṭhatna te, rinawmna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />nunnêmna te, insûm theihna te a ni. Chutiang kalh zâwng Dân a awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Isua Kristaa awmte chuan an tisa châkna te leh duhna te chu an khêngbet tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thlarauva nung kan nih tawh chuan Thlarau hruai ang zêlin i awm ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Incho tawna, inîtsîk tawnin mahni i inngaihlu suh ang u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, miin sual a ti lai phâwk ula, nangni thlarau mite chuan chu mi chu dimdawi takin tundin leh tum ṭhîn rawh u; nangni pawh mahni invêng ṭha ṭheuh ula, thlêmna in tâwk ve dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phur inchhâwk tawn ṭhîn ula; tichuan, Krista dân chu in zâwm a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eng mah ni si lo, mi lian tak nia inngai chu mahni a inbum mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi tinin mahni thiltih enfiah ṭheuh zâwk rawh se, mi dang nêna inteh lovin, mahni thawh tâwk tê têah lâwmna tûr in nei thei ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mi tinin mahni pual phur kan nei ṭheuh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zirtîrna thu dawngtu chuan a zirtîrtu chu thil ṭha a neih ang ang pe ve rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bumin awm suh u, Pathian chu ngaihnêp rual a ni lo ve. Miin a tuh chu a seng leh ngei dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahni tisa lam tâna tuhtu chuan tisaa mi chhiatna a seng ang a, Thlarau lam tâna tuhtu erawh chuan Thlarauva mi chatuan nunna a seng dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thil ṭha tih i ning suh ang u, kan inthlahdah loh zawngin a hun takah kan la seng ngei dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, remchâng kan hmuh apiangin mi tin hnênah thil ṭha ti ila, rinnaa kan chhûngte chungah phei chuan i uar zual ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En teh u, hawrawp hraw pui puia ziak hi keima ziak ngei a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tisa lama intih hmêl mawi tumte chuan serh tan luihtîr che u an tum a, Krista kraws avânga tihduhdah an tuar loh nân an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Serh tante pawh hian Dân chu an zâwm kim bîk hlei nêm. In taksaa chhinchhiahna awm chu an uanpui theih nân serh tantîr che u an tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei zawng, kan Lalpa Isua Krista kraws chauh lo chu chhuan tûr rêng ka nei lo, chu krawsah chuan khawvêl hi ka tân khenbeh a ni a, kei pawh khawvêl tân khenbeh ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miin serh an tan nge tan lo a pawimawh lo, siamtharna hi a pawimawh ber chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />He thu zâwmtu zawng zawng chungah remna leh zahngaihna awm rawh se, Pathian Israel-te chungah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tûn chinah tu mahin mi tibuai tawh suh se, ka taksaa ser awmte hi Krista bawih ka nih chhinchhiahna a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Unaute u, kan Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna chu in hnênah awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
